      48.06,
      379.43,
      544.9,
      563.01
    ],
    "text": "Reference the intestate property of late Mrs. Bamunuge Rohini Wijewardhana who resides in the village of Godagama, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Homagama, in the District of Colombo. It is hereby notified that any person/s who have a claim to or interest in the intestate property of the late Mrs. Bamunuge Rohini Wije-wardhana described in the Schedule hereto should submit his/their claim to the undersigned in writing before 10th January, 2015 stating his/their right or interest to such intestate property. In case of failure to do so, expert action will be taken to register title under Section 55 (2) and (3) of the Registration of Title Act. No. 21 of 1998. GAMINI ILANGARATHNE, Commissioner of Title Settlement. Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Madura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla. 27th November, 2014.",
    "fonts": [
